---
description: Never add Cursor co-author or commit attribution trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to git commits or pull requests.

When creating commits, use plain subject/body only. Do not pass `--trailer` to git commit. If attribution would be injected by the environment, omit it from the commit message.
